     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-loinc-concepts</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-loinc-concepts\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-loinc-concepts\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://loinc.org\"><code>http://loinc.org</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b><a href=\"ValueSet-ng-hiv-snomed-ct-concepts.html\">Nigeria HIV LOINC → SNOMED CT</a></b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/45256-5/\">45256-5</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">HIV treatment clinic transferred to</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/77978-5/\">77978-5</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Patient died from illness of interest</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/45257-3/\">45257-3</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Date dropped from HIV treatment</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/63936-9/\">63936-9</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Start date of treatment or therapy</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/45237-5/\">45237-5</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Date lost to HIV treatment follow-up</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/91382-2/\">91382-2</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Date medication stopped - Reported</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29252-6/\">LA29252-6</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Currently breastfeeding</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29253-4/\">LA29253-4</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Not currently breastfeeding</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA29947-1/\">LA29947-1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Carrier status unknown</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA46-8/\">LA46-8</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Other</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA35-1/\">LA35-1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">No schooling</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA32466-7/\">LA32466-7</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Primary school education</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA32467-5/\">LA32467-5</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">High school education</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA15568-1/\">LA15568-1</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Graduated from a college or university</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA39-3/\">LA39-3</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Technical or trade school</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/63939-3/\">63939-3</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">End date of treatment or therapy</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/67723-7/\">67723-7</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Date of health-related event</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA26438-4/\">LA26438-4</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Yes, I want to become pregnant</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA26440-0/\">LA26440-0</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">No, I don't want to become pregnant</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA15173-0/\">LA15173-0</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Pregnant</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/LA26683-5/\">LA26683-5</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Not pregnant</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/81954-0/\">81954-0</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Date of death [Date]</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/39266-2/\">39266-2</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Follow-up (referred to) provider /specialist Set CPHS</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/45235-9/\">45235-9</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Date original clinic HIV treatment start</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://loinc.org/18934-0/\">